            <description>Use this subagent when the user requests shipping rate quotes for a record, or asks for the fastest or cheapest shipping option, based on a package weight.</description>
            <genAiPluginInstructions>
                <description>Determine the Recipient Record ID: use the current Salesforce record ID if available. If none is available, ask the user for a Record ID.</description>
                <developerName>instructions_0_1788247566731</developerName>
                <language xsi:nil="true"/>
                <masterLabel>instructions_0_1788247566731</masterLabel>
                <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
            </genAiPluginInstructions>
            <genAiPluginInstructions>
                <description>If the Weight is not present in the conversation, ask the user for it. Do not call the shipping rates action until Recipient Record ID and Weight are all known.</description>
                <developerName>instructions_0_1788247894786</developerName>
                <language xsi:nil="true"/>
                <masterLabel>instructions_0_1788247894786</masterLabel>
                <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
            </genAiPluginInstructions>
            <genAiPluginInstructions>
                <description>Once all three values are known, call the Get Shipping Rates action exactly once.</description>
                <developerName>instructions_0_1788252160333</developerName>
                <language xsi:nil="true"/>
                <masterLabel>instructions_0_1788252160333</masterLabel>
                <sortOrder>2</sortOrder>
            </genAiPluginInstructions>
            <genAiPluginInstructions>
                <description>Determine how to present the results based on what the user asked for:
If the user asked for the fastest rate: from the returned entries, find the one with the earliest DeliveryDate. Respond with only that entry (Carrier, ServiceType, Amount, DeliveryDate). Do not list the others.
If the user asked for the cheapest rate: from the returned entries, find the one with the lowest Amount. Respond with only that entry (Carrier, ServiceType, Amount, DeliveryDate). Do not list the others.
If the user did not specify fastest or cheapest: return all entries returned by the action.</description>
                <developerName>instructions_0_1788253269287</developerName>
                <language xsi:nil="true"/>
                <masterLabel>instructions_0_1788253269287</masterLabel>
                <sortOrder>3</sortOrder>
            </genAiPluginInstructions>
            <genAiPluginInstructions>
                <description>return the relavant rates in conversation like all rates if nothing determine , 0nly fastest if determined.</description>
